<entry><title>Hrvatska gubi polovicu snijega u jednom danu dok se otapanje proteže do 1.500 m</title><id>https://snowscope.app/blog/hr/2026/11/croatia-snow-report-16-november-2026.html</id><link href="https://snowscope.app/blog/hr/2026/11/croatia-snow-report-16-november-2026.html"/><published>2026-11-16T20:42:46Z</published><updated>2026-11-16T20:42:46Z</updated><summary>Blage vremenske prilike izbrisale su 950 km² snijega diljem Hrvatske 16. listopada. Ostalo je samo 880 km², većinom iznad 1.500 m. Novi snijeg stiže 21. listopada.</summary></entry>
